    <background>Did I say that she looks good in red?.. Well, I meant she's hot. The Rockstar team also gives her more weapons and gives us some stuntabs...now, when I say a lot more, I mean we get new regiment gear each year, but she, they decorate like she’s going out on parade each time. Polished helmets, clean boots, and she never takes off her mask. There's a squad of super heavies in the company. They, uh never take off their helmets maybe not the exact styling but you get the idea think troll sized, heavy heavy armor, and over the top guns with black and neon pink highlights the highlights might be selectively turned on because it’s UV invisible paint on the armor because when they're on, they don't give a fuck if you know they're coming “Insects, on the other hand, perceive wavelengths of from 650 to 300 nanometers, including the ultraviolet range of the spectrum. What this means is that **most insects don't see well in the yellow, orange and red portion of the spectrum but see ultraviolet very well**.”</background>
